<title>SINGAPORE: IPCO plunges to S$14.75 mln 1st half loss.</title>
<headline>IPCO plunges to S$14.75 mln 1st half loss.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				14.75  vs    1.02 (profit)</p>
<p>    Loss per share (cents)	    37.00  vs    3.00 (profit)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     149.52  vs  113.43</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	1.18  vs    0.96</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   0.12  vs    0.01</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	     0.82  vs    0.54</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	    4.64  vs    0.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss			  29.26  vs    2.29 (profit)</p>
<p>    Tax					2.79  vs    0.24</p>
